{"878634d2-ea39-4001-a4bf-31458020d16a":{"id":"878634d2-ea39-4001-a4bf-31458020d16a","title":"Akuyaku Reijou Level 99 ~Watashi wa Ura Boss desuga Maou de wa Arimasen~","altTitle":"Villainess Level 99: I May Be the Hidden Boss but I’m Not the Demon Lord","description":"Aku bereinkarnasi menjadi antagonis \"Dolkness Eumelia\" dari gim otome RPG. Di cerita utamanya, Eumelia hanyalah seorang karakter sampingan, tapi setelah ending, ia memasuki cerita lagi dengan menjadi bos rahasia, menjadi karakter yang mempunyai status lebih tinggi daripada pahlawan!!  \n  \nMemantik jiwa gamer-ku, lalu mengambil kesempatan karena ditinggal oleh keluargaku di wilayah mereka, aku berlatih! Berlatih! Lalu pada akhir pelatihanku saat aku baru memasuki akademi, ternyata levelku mencapai 99.  \n  \nWalaupun aku sudah membuat rencana untuk hidup tanpa mencolok dan damai, beberapa saat setelah masuk sekolah, aku disangka \"Raja Iblis\" oleh si Heroine dan Para Target Cintanya …?  \n  \nDiangkat dari Web Novel yang populer yang mencari kehidupan damai, sebuah cerita fantasi tentang antagonis terkuat!","year":2020,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Comedy","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/878634d2-ea39-4001-a4bf-31458020d16a/4d34538d-e76b-44db-ba7e-f7e7d13c9ade.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","vi","id","tr","pt-br","fr","th"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.87,"follows":145257,"listAt":"2026-10-25T00:57:41.085Z","chapters":[{"id":"51fef450-3756-4468-97bb-440abb901241","number":"25.3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2026-08-19T18:04:17+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"78c23b41-0787-4e13-aaa8-7bf3a171f7dd","number":"25.2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2026-08-19T18:03:48+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"aafe57a7-f966-4f23-b604-e7a7ceb7c211","number":"25.1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2026-08-19T18